    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Potion, Very Rare</em></p><p>You regain 9d4 + 9 Hit Points and one expended spell slot of level 1 to 5 (your choice) when you drink this potion.</p><p>Whatever its potency, the potion’s magenta liquid glows faintly from within.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-vyMA6BCwZCXiHtqd\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Chaque <em>Drink</em> rend les points de vie et l’emplacement de sort de son niveau ; <em>Drink: Hit Points Only</em> sert aux créatures sans emplacement de ce niveau.</p></section>",
